+    /// LOCAL (Atlas): a batch of the command buffer `id` planned after its commit (it waited for an
+    /// event, under the scheduler's lock) meets the surface's bytes, which its commit's copy back
+    /// (`shadow_lazy::met_by`) covered only as far as what ran then: what completed since syncs
